==Battleground==
*1 [[Yuma Kuga & Doge]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*4 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] to take down the enemies. In 3-crown, you may need [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] as well (his [[True Form]] can actually solo the boss although will die to a Celeboodle afterwards).

